# Mero Sadak — Environment Configuration
#
# This file documents required environment variables for both the
# Express dev server (server.ts) and the Cloudflare Worker.
#
# WARNING: Never commit real secrets to version control.
# Use `wrangler secret put` for Worker secrets, and secure vaults
# for server-side credentials.

# --- Cloudflare Worker Secrets (set via `wrangler secret put`) ---
# TOMTOM_API_KEY: TomTom Traffic API key for live traffic & incidents
# GEMINI_API_KEY: Google Gemini AI API key for route assistant
# OPENWEATHERMAP_API_KEY: OpenWeatherMap API key (weather fallback)
# WAZE_FEED_URL: Waze Partner Hub feed URL for crowd-sourced traffic
# DOR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL: Google Sheet CSV URL for DoR road closures

# --- Cloudflare Worker Config (set in wrangler.toml or `wrangler secret put`) ---
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL: Upstash Redis REST endpoint for AI cache
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN: Upstash Redis auth token
# ALLOWED_ORIGIN: CORS allowed origin (e.g. https://merosadak.web.app)

# --- Express Dev Server (.env, not committed) ---
# PORT: Server port (default 3000)
# GEMINI_API_KEY: Same key as Worker (for dev server AI calls)
# VITE_WORKER_URL: Override worker base URL in development
